      "review_description": "It was an easy process with Paul as he explained everything in depth. He answered all our questions nicely.Explained what will happen during installation and afterwards.He bought box of sweets for the workers as he checked on them to see everything was going smoothly. We also got a box of sweets.The installation guys were on time and was careful on our roof and also sealed any tiles that was lose. Cleaned up nicely too.We were showen how everything is work and what to do when something goes wrong. Also the support team has helped me to understand the information on the app.We highly recommend Paul and Go Green Home Solar company to anyone looking to install Solar as this was the best investment for our family. Paul is kind professional and knowledgeable friendly person.We have had our 10.5KW Solar system installed five months now and we haven't had any issues or problems. The best outcome from this is we haven't paid one single electricity bill and we are in credit of $1700 +",
