      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I contracted Go Solar Go Green to install my solar panel system at my home. The installer that came to my house installed everything in a single day and the system was supposed to be fully operative. This wasn't the case. I thought that the system was producing energy until but the inverter wasn't sending any data to the app in my iPad. When I called the inverter company (SMA) to ask them about the lights that were on in the inverter they said that the inverter had been set to international settings, and it should be to the Australian, hence there was no energy output.I do have to say that Raj who I have been dealing with he is very responsive, but the installer that they used is not very customer service focused....I'd say ensure that the system if fully operative, that the inverter is sending data and information straight from the beginning and... don't pay them until this is to your 120% satisfaction.",
